<title>UK: Fannie Mae prices NZ$500 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae prices NZ$500 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following global bond has been priced, joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Toronto-Dominion said on Friday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL NATIONAL MORTGAGE ASSOCIATION</p>
<p> AMT     NZ$500 MLN   COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    20.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.773    PAY DATE    20.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    99.773    SPREAD	+21 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND MARCH 2002 N.Z. GOVERNMENT BOND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
